  "raw_text": "s. Now, let's talk about novelty versus routine. When do you try new items versus sticking to your usual? User: If I'm really hungry I usually stick to my usual if I'm somewhere new or if I want something else I might try a new item. Agent: That makes sense. Could you give me one recent example of when you tried a new item and explain why, and then one recent example of when you stuck to your usual and explain why? User: I tried the McDonald's I think they had a hot buffalo sandwich which I didn't like too much it just looked good on the ad and I just decided to get it. Agent: Thank you for that example of trying the McDonald's hot buffalo sandwich because it looked good in the ad. Now, could you give me a recent example of when you stuck to your usual order and explain why you chose to do so?",
